# Payku SDK

- Default to Bun for install, test, build, and scripts.
- Do not use dotenv; Bun loads `.env` automatically.
- Keep secrets out of commits, logs, and examples.
- Follow `docs/sdk-spec.md` for public API naming and module layout.
- Prefer `Payku.forCountry()` when changing country-scoped DX.
- Run `bun run lint && bun run build && bun run test:unit` after substantive edits.
